        "mission_intent": "Please update our firm's risk assessment methodology documentation and related audit programs to align with the upcoming amendments to PCAOB AS 2110, specifically the changes to paragraphs .05 and .41 that were adopted under PCAOB Release No. 2024-005 and approved by the SEC. We need the revised methodology to be rolled out to all engagement teams well in advance of the effective date so that teams have adequate time for training and dry-run application on at least one pilot engagement before the standard becomes mandatory. The update should cover how engagement teams identify and assess risks of material misstatement, including any changes to the procedures for obtaining an understanding of the entity and its environment, and should reference the related staff audit practice alerts for implementation guidance. Please coordinate with the learning and development group to build a training module and distribute it firm-wide. I'd like a draft of the revised methodology and training outline ready for the Standards Committee's review by the end of Q1 next year, with final rollout completed no later than sixty days before the amendments take effect.",
